S150: Solve the problem where GlobalGameUICanvas blocks level element selection in Scene view.

Changes:
- ProjectSettings/TagManager.asset: Register UI_WorldSpace on Layer slot 7
- New: Assets/Scripts/Editor/UIWorldSpaceLayerSetup.cs (InitializeOnLoad)
  * Auto-assign UI_WorldSpace Layer to GlobalGameUICanvas and all children
    on scene open/save and play mode transitions
  * Edit Mode: auto-hide UI_WorldSpace in Scene view via Tools.visibleLayers
  * Play Mode: auto-restore visibility for UI debugging
  * IsAutoHideEnabled toggle persisted via EditorPrefs
- Assets/Scripts/Editor/GlobalGameUICanvasPrefabBuilder.cs:
  * Set UI_WorldSpace Layer when creating prefab asset

Safety: Canvas uses ScreenSpaceOverlay render mode (not affected by
Camera.cullingMask), so changing Layer has zero impact on runtime UI.
No Camera or Physics settings modified.
